<</A 47 0 R/Alt(\(A\) An orange fruit hanging from a tree branch with leaves, under a clear blue sky.  \(B\) A smaller orange fruit on a branch with surrounding green leaves, in a field setting.  \(C\) Two larger orange fruits on a tree branch, surrounded by foliage in an outdoor environment.)/K 0/P 8 0 R/Pg 34 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

16 0 obj
<</A 48 0 R/Alt(Two images show a yellow citrus fruit on a tree. Image A displays the fruit naturally. Image B highlights the fruit with a yellow outline and labels it \215Citrus\216 with a red arrow pointing to it.)/K 0/P 8 0 R/Pg 35 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

17 0 obj
<</A 49 0 R/Alt(Flowchart illustrating a neural network architecture with sections labeled Backbone, Neck, and Head. It includes components like GhostConv, C2f, CBAM, SPPF, Conv, Bottleneck, and MaxPoo12d arranged in sequences and branches. Arrows indicate the data flow through these layers.)/K 0/P 8 0 R/Pg 36 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

