<</A 50 0 R/Alt<>/K 1/P 8 0 R/Pg 36 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

19 0 obj
<</A 51 0 R/Alt(Diagram of a Convolutional Block Attention Module \(CBAM\) depicting an input feature processed through a Channel Attention Module \(green\) and Spatial Attention Module \(purple\), yielding a refined feature.)/K 0/P 8 0 R/Pg 37 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

20 0 obj
<</A 52 0 R/Alt(Three images labeled A, B, and C depict citrus fruits hanging from tree branches. A shows greenish-yellow fruit, B displays two bright yellow fruits, and C features a single yellow fruit. The ground is covered with a reflective plastic sheet.)/K 0/P 8 0 R/Pg 38 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

21 0 obj
<</A 53 0 R/Alt(Two images show citrus fruits hanging from a tree branch. Image A displays the fruits naturally. Image B includes annotations with labels indicating \215Stem 1,\216 \215Stem 2,\216 \215Citrus 1,\216 and \215Citrus 2,\216 with lines pointing to respective parts of the fruits and branches.)/K 0/P 8 0 R/Pg 39 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

22 0 obj
<</A 54 0 R/Alt(Sequence of images showing the extraction process of a leaf's vein pattern. Panel A shows an original leaf image. Panel B shows a silhouette of the leaf. Panel C refines the shape. Panel D highlights the vein in green. Panel E adds a blue dot highlighting a specific point on the vein.)/K 1/P 8 0 R/Pg 39 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

23 0 obj
<</A 55 0 R/Alt(Three sets of images labeled A, B, and C depict citrus fruit on trees with AI detection boxes. Each set shows three consecutive images, displaying detection probability scores for stems and citrus fruits. The settings have a rural background with visible markers highlighting the identified fruits and their confidence levels, ranging around 0.5 to 0.9.)/K 0/P 8 0 R/Pg 40 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

24 0 obj
<</A 56 0 R/Alt(Six-panel image comparing citrus fruit on branches. In each pair, the left image \(A\) shows fruit naturally while the right image \(B\) highlights the fruit with green markings. The setting is an outdoor orchard with clear skies and planted rows of citrus trees.)/K 0/P 8 0 R/Pg 43 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
endobj

