<</A 57 0 R/Alt(Two panels show oranges on a tree. Panel A displays oranges with a natural, uneven color. Panel B shows the same oranges digitally altered to appear uniformly bright yellow. The background includes a farm setting.)/K 0/P 8 0 R/Pg 44 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>
